harmonypy MCP package
=====================

This package wraps harmonypy 2.0.2:
  repository: https://github.com/slowkow/harmonypy
  commit:     dbd0984705530761f1e0a11ab5744345935437a0 (tag v2.0.2)
  paper:      Korsunsky et al., Nature Methods 16, 1289-1296 (2019),
              doi:10.1038/s41592-019-0619-0
  license:    GPL-3.0-or-later
  copyright:  (C) 2018 Ilya Korsunsky, 2019 Kamil Slowikowski and contributors

harmonypy source is not redistributed in this package; the pinned PyPI release
is installed from src/requirements.txt (sdist sha256
0d6e4491edb4638db3ab8d90fdc961df8b4d9b46d80b30afadaaf5026f102a7d; all files
shipped in the sdist and wheel were verified byte-identical to the pinned
commit). This wrapper is distributed under the same license; see LICENSE.
